Begin general chemistry from zero (@gc-reading: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @general-chemistry, #source "sources/Chemistry-OpenStax.lingua#r_02Y5N2VMTTPBDSNYPD4Z26EZ94", #source "sources/Chem1-Lower.lingua#r_0NFQA43WZVMECZY6SKZJMRXWBZ", #source "sources/Quimica-Geral-I-UECE.lingua#r_7N9JXVMC5DWB8P3MX79YYPHNPA", #general-chemistry "foundations/A-chemical-question.lingua#r_7Y7E3QBYQADPGQ06JXY84FCEVN") { r_0470T6ZDV7KCP63TE2D5GX9ANG
**Read:** [Chemistry 2e — Flowers, Theopold, Langley, and Robinson](sources/Chemistry-OpenStax.lingua#r_02Y5N2VMTTPBDSNYPD4Z26EZ94), the whole book with exercises, in successive chapter blocks; [Chem1 General Chemistry Virtual Textbook — Stephen Lower](sources/Chem1-Lower.lingua#r_0NFQA43WZVMECZY6SKZJMRXWBZ), the complete introductory and first/second-semester text; [Química Geral I — Feitosa, Barbosa, and Forte](sources/Quimica-Geral-I-UECE.lingua#r_7N9JXVMC5DWB8P3MX79YYPHNPA), the whole Portuguese companion.

Begin with a material and a question, then learn the symbols and quantitative tools where the question needs them. No prior chemistry course is assumed. [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2) supplies arithmetic, units, functions, graphs, and balances without requiring every mathematical subject to be completed first.

Read [Chemistry 2e — Flowers, Theopold, Langley, and Robinson](sources/Chemistry-OpenStax.lingua#r_02Y5N2VMTTPBDSNYPD4Z26EZ94) completely over the progression, including substantial exercises. [Chem1 General Chemistry Virtual Textbook — Stephen Lower](sources/Chem1-Lower.lingua#r_0NFQA43WZVMECZY6SKZJMRXWBZ) supplies a second whole first/second-semester treatment and later advanced applications. [Química Geral I — Feitosa, Barbosa, and Forte](sources/Quimica-Geral-I-UECE.lingua#r_7N9JXVMC5DWB8P3MX79YYPHNPA) is a complete Portuguese companion for the introductory structure, matter, bonding, and acid/base scope. Read full chapter blocks early and precise passages when a later problem becomes specific.

Use the first chemical study to connect the opening concepts with an inspectable balance and observation. Continue through energy, atomic/electronic structure, bonding, phases/solutions, kinetics, and equilibria, returning to missing preparation at the point of use. [Principles of Chemical Science — MIT 5.111SC, Fall 2014](sources/MIT-5-111SC.lingua#r_312Z44VT67CCX60KG27PWM6NZ8) supplies a full course and independent problem/exam benchmark; [Principles of Chemical Science — MIT 5.112, Fall 2005](sources/MIT-5-112.lingua#r_05VDAXGTY0M9E5K9TMJTWTFNAG) is the stronger later treatment with its stated chemistry/calculus preparation.

Read [Química geral no laboratório — Marcela Boroski, organizer](sources/Quimica-geral-no-laboratorio.lingua#r_48YEN2SA34DW0FPCSTMVTW3CTD) in full for sustained experimental work, together with the safety references and actual supervised laboratory preparation. [Analytical Chemistry 2.1 — David Harvey](sources/Analytical-Chemistry-Harvey.lingua#r_0XMY75E3FRXRGR3BK28V3JAC0T) deepens chemical measurement and systematic solution calculations through the assigned complete chapters. [Quantities, Units and Symbols in Physical Chemistry — IUPAC Green Book](sources/IUPAC-Green-Book.lingua#r_5SR8CP04E580VSV69MYQNSZ73F) becomes a whole-volume advanced reference for definitions and conventions, with evaluated data and primary research used critically rather than bulk-ingested.

The practical programme, coupled-equilibrium study, kinetics investigation, material-chain study, and independent research supply the later practical/academic depth. [What completing general chemistry means](research/Completion.lingua#r_0F3AN0M8QY98NA42NVQS00D48F) states the evidence expected at the end. A readable first step and a demanding finish coexist through ordinary connected Records; no separate Trail feature or fixed number of levels is required.

